Package: nbzinbAmoah
Title: Negative Binomial and Zero-Inflated Negative Binomial Regression
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Abigail", "Amoah", , "amoaha@miamioh.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits negative binomial (NB) regression via iteratively reweighted
    least squares (IRLS) alternated with Newton-Raphson for the dispersion
    parameter, and zero-inflated negative binomial (ZINB) regression via an
    EM algorithm whose M-steps are IRLS. Estimation is performed entirely
    without general-purpose optimizers.
